Package: aetherion
Version: @VERSION@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: PerfLabZDV
Depends: @DEPENDS@
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Homepage: https://github.com/PerfLabZDV/aetherion
Description: performance tests in PerfLang, on one machine or on workers
 Aetherion runs performance test suites written in PerfLang: virtual users,
 stages, request metrics, machine and energy metrics, and pass criteria.
 .
 The aetherion command runs a suite on this machine, or on workers: other
 servers with this package whose aetherion-worker service runs the virtual
 users for it. The package holds its own Erlang runtime.
